WEBVTT

00:21.160 --> 00:22.390
Hey, bug!

00:22.390 --> 00:24.120
Can't you fly any faster?

00:24.380 --> 00:27.370
At this rate, all the turtles will be killed!

00:27.370 --> 00:32.550
I can't believe I'm allowing 
humans to ride on my noble body.

00:33.250 --> 00:36.050
That's... the crazy turtle!

00:36.310 --> 00:38.090
Hey, gator!

00:38.090 --> 00:39.570
Hey, you!

00:39.570 --> 00:42.950
Have you seen someone with huge wings?

00:42.950 --> 00:46.560
I sure did. Someone with 
huge wings zoomed by.

00:46.820 --> 00:49.080
They flew toward that shop.

00:52.010 --> 00:55.100
There's so much I want to tell you.

00:55.100 --> 00:57.370
So much has happened.

00:59.510 --> 01:00.540
Wangnan?

01:01.200 --> 01:04.070
Gator and Yihwa, head to the shop!

01:04.070 --> 01:05.580
Quaetro and I

01:05.840 --> 01:07.740
<i>will head to the teammate summoning station!</i>

01:07.740 --> 01:09.590
You're gonna give me a ride, too?

01:09.590 --> 01:10.590
Hurry!

01:11.260 --> 01:12.960
Before he can do anything!

01:14.590 --> 01:15.770
Wangnan!

02:47.020 --> 02:51.020
<b>Episode 23</b>

02:47.020 --> 02:51.020
<b>The End of Dawn</b>

02:59.430 --> 03:00.940
<i>Wangnan!</i>

03:00.940 --> 03:04.310
<i>You're not a match participant! 
What are you doing?</i>

03:04.310 --> 03:07.150
Oh, but I am.

03:07.150 --> 03:08.220
<i>What?!</i>

03:08.220 --> 03:10.920
Just you wait. Before long,

03:10.920 --> 03:13.420
I'll kill you, too.

03:13.730 --> 03:15.540
Why would you do this?

03:15.840 --> 03:18.050
I'm the one you hate!

03:18.530 --> 03:21.300
Why would you hurt the others?

03:21.300 --> 03:23.300
Didn't I tell you, finished product?

03:23.300 --> 03:26.420
I'm doing this to inflict despair on you.

03:27.170 --> 03:30.650
I don't know how you escaped my trap, 
but I won't waste this opportunity.

03:30.650 --> 03:34.310
You can stand there and 
watch as your friends die

03:34.620 --> 03:36.570
in the depths of despair.

03:38.250 --> 03:40.640
Now, shall we begin?

03:40.640 --> 03:44.600
Either way, he won't last long like this.

03:44.600 --> 03:46.890
I'll put him out of his misery.

03:46.890 --> 03:47.830
<i>Don't!</i>

03:49.860 --> 03:52.580
<i>Damn it. At this rate, he'll die for nothing.</i>

03:52.970 --> 03:54.330
<i>We have to forfeit.</i>

04:03.910 --> 04:06.290
<i>Gator! How'd you know to come here?</i>

04:06.290 --> 04:08.560
I followed that damn turt—

04:09.670 --> 04:12.100
Curry turtle...

04:13.930 --> 04:15.100
You bastard!

04:15.100 --> 04:16.800
You'll pay for this!

04:17.190 --> 04:20.510
What's this? More people to kill?

04:20.510 --> 04:24.360
Wake up and get to work, you idiot!

04:27.230 --> 04:30.730
<i>Who is that strange man?</i>

04:32.810 --> 04:34.000
You...

04:34.790 --> 04:36.560
Did you swallow something?

04:49.080 --> 04:51.400
You got here sooner than I expected.

04:52.590 --> 04:54.950
Did you defeat their first member?

04:54.950 --> 04:56.650
<i>Not yet. Where's Khun?</i>

04:57.020 --> 04:58.640
He's not here yet.

04:58.640 --> 05:03.900
He said to farm points defeating Team 
Snake members if you guys showed up first.

05:04.230 --> 05:08.370
Why farm points if he hasn't even come 
to the teammate summoning station?

05:08.370 --> 05:11.040
<i>Don't ask me. I don't know, either.</i>

05:11.040 --> 05:12.910
All right!

05:13.400 --> 05:17.280
<i>I don't know what's going on,
but let's head inside.</i>

05:20.570 --> 05:23.640
Seriously? There's no one here.

05:23.640 --> 05:26.440
Where did that snake woman go?

05:27.100 --> 05:28.940
Reflejo.

05:29.290 --> 05:32.580
<i>I had Miya leave the arena.</i>

05:33.130 --> 05:37.590
<i>Now Team Ramenmaru has no way to earn points.</i>

05:38.050 --> 05:40.310
Well done. Good work.

05:40.910 --> 05:43.710
Without points, they can't summon anyone.

05:44.140 --> 05:47.950
Do whatever it takes to find 
Viole in the remaining time.

05:47.950 --> 05:51.190
Stop him from escaping, no matter what.

05:51.190 --> 05:52.640
<i>Roger that.</i>

05:52.640 --> 05:56.190
<i>And another thing. I have 
a message from Cassano.</i>

05:59.120 --> 06:01.710
<i>What? He swallowed something?</i>

06:02.150 --> 06:05.840
I mean there's something alien inside him.

06:06.440 --> 06:09.530
The flow of Shinsu in his head 
is particularly abnormal.

06:09.980 --> 06:12.880
I sense multiple entities. 
Perhaps it's a parasite.

06:13.570 --> 06:15.310
<i>Can you remove it?</i>

06:15.900 --> 06:20.240
Yes, but why would I do that?

06:20.240 --> 06:21.880
Sounds like a hassle.

06:21.880 --> 06:23.360
<i>Gator, bite him.</i>

06:25.510 --> 06:27.680
Hey, wait! What are you doing?

06:27.680 --> 06:29.930
Okay! Okay, fine!

06:29.930 --> 06:31.820
You guys are interesting.

06:31.820 --> 06:34.490
How are you going to remove it?

06:35.210 --> 06:37.550
It's simple, you monster.

06:37.550 --> 06:40.840
I'll use Shinsu to shake that 
thing inside your head.

06:41.950 --> 06:43.880
Somehow, I expected more.

06:44.630 --> 06:46.780
Even a monster like you

06:47.470 --> 06:49.520
can experience motion sickness.

06:55.140 --> 06:57.640
<i>Damn. They figured it out.</i>

06:57.640 --> 07:01.080
So that's their actual first member?

07:01.080 --> 07:01.900
Gator!

07:08.310 --> 07:09.030
Damn it!

07:11.110 --> 07:13.780
Thanks for telling me its weakness.

07:13.780 --> 07:17.290
I'll have to affix it 
more solidly next time.

07:14.550 --> 07:17.290
I have to do something.

07:22.510 --> 07:23.170
That's not good!

07:23.170 --> 07:24.420
You're too late!

07:24.740 --> 07:26.170
No matter what.

07:37.660 --> 07:39.930
You finally got it to work.

07:40.860 --> 07:44.440
Your training paid off.

07:46.670 --> 07:50.930
This is all thanks to you, Viole.

07:51.670 --> 07:52.700
Come to us!

07:53.220 --> 07:56.020
Summon Jue Viole Grace!

07:56.020 --> 07:57.080
You...

07:57.930 --> 07:59.700
<i>Code successfully entered.</i>

07:59.700 --> 08:01.360
<i>Begin summoning.</i>

08:02.320 --> 08:06.590
<i>Jue Viole Grace will be 
summoned in five minutes.</i>

08:07.340 --> 08:08.210
I'll kill you!

08:08.210 --> 08:09.840
Puke turtle!

08:16.580 --> 08:18.610
Turtle, are you okay?

08:19.240 --> 08:21.230
I'm fine.

08:24.010 --> 08:26.990
I'm not dying after coming this far.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.880
I'll suck it up.

08:31.160 --> 08:35.550
It's not clear why, but Team 
Snake has forfeited the game.

08:35.550 --> 08:37.580
Team Ramenmaru defeats

08:37.580 --> 08:40.780
the opposing team's first member 
through Yeon Yihwa's efforts

08:40.780 --> 08:44.210
while engaging a mysterious 
opponent in a fierce battle.

08:44.540 --> 08:48.050
<i>Which means they're at the shop.</i>

08:48.780 --> 08:49.460
Vespa.

08:49.750 --> 08:51.830
<i>Summon Endorsi.</i>

08:51.830 --> 08:53.130
Yes, sir.

08:53.130 --> 08:55.720
<i>You two, come with me to the shop.</i>

08:56.780 --> 09:00.440
I'll handle things here, so 
capture them as soon as you can.

09:00.440 --> 09:02.980
The audience will just 
think it's a special event.

09:02.980 --> 09:04.920
Make it look as natural as possible.

09:05.410 --> 09:06.270
Io!

09:06.720 --> 09:07.650
Punk.

09:07.980 --> 09:09.480
Where have you been?

09:09.480 --> 09:11.520
People are losing their minds over here.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.930
What?!

09:15.040 --> 09:18.620
Honestly, you're endlessly irritating.

09:18.620 --> 09:23.120
Hand him over! You don't 
want to make me any angrier.

09:23.120 --> 09:26.730
I think not, you impudent puke turtle!

09:26.730 --> 09:28.880
If you want him, come and get him!

09:29.290 --> 09:33.130
You think I can't?

09:36.930 --> 09:38.890
Gator, grab onto Laure!

09:52.400 --> 09:59.910
I told you I didn't want to get involved 
with that monster because it'd be a hassle.

10:00.290 --> 10:01.290
Monster?

10:01.830 --> 10:03.590
He's no longer human.

10:04.120 --> 10:07.790
He's not even manipulating 
his Shinsu himself.

10:07.790 --> 10:09.290
What do you mean?

10:09.290 --> 10:12.120
I'm not sure. This is the 
Workshop we're talking about.

10:12.120 --> 10:13.920
Maybe they put something inside him

10:14.450 --> 10:16.740
to turn him into a monster.

10:26.390 --> 10:28.390
Damn it...

10:28.860 --> 10:31.400
The other leg is moving toward the spring!

10:32.670 --> 10:34.360
What a pain.

10:40.660 --> 10:44.990
Move your stinking leg!

10:44.990 --> 10:46.270
Finish it!

10:50.120 --> 10:51.120
Is it over?

10:51.850 --> 10:53.500
<i>Don't celebrate yet.</i>

10:53.890 --> 10:55.820
<i>We're just getting started.</i>

10:56.480 --> 10:59.780
I didn't expect to have to use this, too.

11:15.650 --> 11:16.580
Gross!

11:17.380 --> 11:18.990
What is that thing?

11:22.110 --> 11:24.370
<i>Viole will arrive in three minutes.</i>

11:24.890 --> 11:26.620
You have to hold on until then!

11:26.620 --> 11:29.370
No, this ends now.

11:29.370 --> 11:31.290
What a shame, Viole.

11:31.290 --> 11:36.250
You got to see your friends again, 
but all you can do is watch.

11:36.250 --> 11:40.530
<i>You just wait. I'll kill you soon, too.</i>

11:40.530 --> 11:41.840
I've had enough of you.

11:41.840 --> 11:42.550
<i>Beta!</i>

11:43.850 --> 11:46.010
Stop what you're doing, Beta.

11:46.010 --> 11:46.850
<i>Who is that?</i>

11:47.600 --> 11:50.800
<i>Judging by her clothes...
is she a Workshop researcher?</i>

11:50.800 --> 11:53.100
Why are you doing this?

11:53.610 --> 11:55.040
<i>This is convenient.</i>

11:55.040 --> 11:57.110
<i>This will help us buy time.</i>

11:57.110 --> 12:00.500
Stop this at once and return to the lab.

12:00.500 --> 12:03.070
If you do this again, you'll...

12:03.070 --> 12:05.620
Shut up! Don't tell me what to do.

12:07.030 --> 12:10.120
Can't you see the monster you created?

12:10.440 --> 12:16.010
Emily told me I'm not human anymore.
That I'm a weapon.

12:16.010 --> 12:19.630
That I became a weapon to get revenge.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.240
Beta...

12:21.240 --> 12:24.890
So I'll destroy everything with my own hands!

12:25.170 --> 12:28.390
Kill... Kill... Kill...

12:28.390 --> 12:29.890
Kill!

12:30.640 --> 12:32.570
Jue Viole Grace!

12:32.570 --> 12:35.700
You're the reason all of this started!

12:41.190 --> 12:42.900
This can't be good.

12:43.130 --> 12:46.770
He's even crazier than I thought.

12:46.770 --> 12:47.660
What?

12:47.660 --> 12:51.410
Team Snake has forfeited? That means...

12:51.720 --> 12:53.440
<i>Shibisu, can you hear me?</i>

12:53.750 --> 12:56.770
Khun, what's going on with you guys?

12:56.770 --> 12:58.720
<i>Sorry. I'll explain later.</i>

12:58.720 --> 13:01.420
<i>More importantly, you have to 
forfeit the match right away.</i>

13:01.420 --> 13:02.800
What?!

13:03.100 --> 13:07.300
Once the match has ended, summoning 
should become instantaneous.

13:07.300 --> 13:08.550
It's over!

13:08.550 --> 13:09.550
Hurry!

13:09.550 --> 13:10.560
Damn it!

13:15.600 --> 13:17.380
Beta, no!

13:26.030 --> 13:27.940
Wh-What is that?

13:35.610 --> 13:37.250
<i>The match has ended.</i>

13:37.250 --> 13:39.250
<i>Loading complete.</i>

13:39.250 --> 13:46.080
<i>Jue Viole Grace has been 
summoned to the shop.</i>

13:54.020 --> 13:55.520
We made it in time.

13:57.400 --> 13:59.020
Finished product...

13:59.710 --> 14:00.570
Viole!

14:00.570 --> 14:01.770
Black turtle!

14:02.150 --> 14:05.900
Rak, please take Wangnan to a safe place.

14:05.900 --> 14:06.920
Got it.

14:08.910 --> 14:10.660
You won't run this time, will you?

14:11.530 --> 14:12.910
Don't worry.

14:18.450 --> 14:20.490
<i>He's the one...</i>

14:26.390 --> 14:32.080
I managed to stop his attack, 
but my lighthouse is damaged.

14:32.080 --> 14:34.060
It won't last much longer.

14:34.460 --> 14:42.190
You didn't leave that place 
to come talk to me, did you?

14:42.870 --> 14:44.060
No.

14:45.690 --> 14:47.530
Good!

14:54.250 --> 14:57.160
Such feeble attacks won't work against me!

14:57.620 --> 15:00.920
What's the matter, finished product?
You disappoint me!

15:05.670 --> 15:08.710
The tournament is over.

15:08.710 --> 15:10.800
Why don't you play nice and leave?

15:11.250 --> 15:15.930
I'm irritated that you ruined our reunion.

15:17.110 --> 15:23.690
I envy you, Viole. You have 
friends who protect you.

15:24.030 --> 15:28.040
I lost everything because of you.

15:29.170 --> 15:33.590
Only five of us survived 
the repeated experiments.

15:33.590 --> 15:36.910
We were more like family than friends.

15:38.920 --> 15:44.010
One day, the Workshop researchers 
gathered us and said...

15:44.710 --> 15:46.460
Kill each other!

15:46.460 --> 15:50.720
Only one of you will become 
a completed Ignition Weapon!

15:51.000 --> 15:55.720
The last one standing will 
be granted their freedom!

15:57.640 --> 16:01.330
"Freedom." That one word 
made us lose our minds.

16:01.330 --> 16:05.860
Kill! Kill! Kill!

16:02.490 --> 16:05.860
Kill! Kill! Kill!

16:08.190 --> 16:11.510
In the end, they all died.

16:14.900 --> 16:21.470
But I couldn't survive a single day 
without the Workshop's medicine.

16:22.320 --> 16:24.490
It was all a lie.

16:24.490 --> 16:30.300
From the beginning, I would never be 
permitted to have friends or freedom.

16:30.560 --> 16:34.800
But you're trying to have it all.

16:34.800 --> 16:36.880
You can't be serious!

16:41.430 --> 16:43.690
Khun, protect Yihwa!

16:51.210 --> 16:53.350
<i>Normal attacks won't work against him.</i>

16:53.350 --> 16:56.070
<i>I have to finish this in 
one blow, like Laure did.</i>

17:15.930 --> 17:18.850
Why do you blame me for everything?

17:19.080 --> 17:20.670
Shut up!

17:22.430 --> 17:24.270
FUG is responsible for all of this!

17:24.270 --> 17:25.480
You know that, don't you?

17:25.940 --> 17:29.180
So what? Are you saying you 
have nothing to do with this?

17:29.180 --> 17:29.940
I don't!

17:30.860 --> 17:35.070
At the very least, it's not 
a reason to hurt my friends!

17:35.700 --> 17:39.000
It's wrong!

17:49.170 --> 17:51.770
You had no choice but to hate me.

17:52.490 --> 17:56.880
You needed an outlet for 
your hate in order to live.

17:57.990 --> 18:01.890
Don't talk like you know me.

18:09.930 --> 18:10.900
Beta!

18:10.900 --> 18:14.070
I'll kill you, finished product!

18:17.450 --> 18:20.840
This will only make both of us unhappy.

18:21.380 --> 18:22.990
Unhappy?!

18:22.990 --> 18:27.930
Good! I won't stop until you're unhappy!

18:30.770 --> 18:32.670
Please, don't do this anymore!

18:42.140 --> 18:45.040
Not even Phobos was enough.

18:45.620 --> 18:47.640
Congratulations, Viole!

18:47.900 --> 18:51.460
You've finally acquired everything!

18:51.460 --> 18:56.440
Friends, power, and freedom! It's all yours!

18:56.440 --> 18:59.950
You're the greatest! Congratulations!

18:59.950 --> 19:01.860
You bastard!

19:01.860 --> 19:02.820
Bam!

19:03.340 --> 19:07.680
You've acquired everything, 
and I lost everything.

19:07.680 --> 19:13.380
Everything you have was originally ours!

19:13.380 --> 19:15.810
You're wrong. It's mine.

19:19.200 --> 19:23.950
Since the moment I was born, 
I was trapped in darkness.

19:25.220 --> 19:28.220
But I found a single light.

19:29.000 --> 19:31.720
I followed it to this Tower.

19:34.810 --> 19:39.440
The memories I made with the people 
I met here are precious to me.

19:39.920 --> 19:42.240
Even as we hurt each other, 
we protected one another.

19:42.490 --> 19:44.040
They're my treasure.

19:44.040 --> 19:45.290
You bastard...

19:45.290 --> 19:47.310
Beta, that's enough.

19:48.170 --> 19:52.280
Your experiment had nothing to do with him.

19:52.280 --> 19:54.750
He's not the one you should hate.

19:55.030 --> 19:59.510
That can't be right! She clearly told me...

19:59.510 --> 20:04.010
<b>Emily
The experiments performed on you
 were performed to create Jue Viole Grace.</b>

20:00.730 --> 20:03.440
Did Emily lie?

20:08.810 --> 20:09.520
Beta!

20:09.790 --> 20:11.520
Quickly! He needs his medicine!

20:11.520 --> 20:13.390
Don't move.

20:13.390 --> 20:14.420
Restrain him.

20:15.830 --> 20:17.270
Wh-What's going on?

20:18.120 --> 20:19.990
Whose orders are you acting on?

20:19.990 --> 20:21.490
The higher-ups.

20:21.490 --> 20:23.780
We've been instructed to 
dispose of test subject Beta.

20:24.520 --> 20:29.540
<i>It's none of my business if he dies, 
but this doesn't sit right with me.</i>

20:30.640 --> 20:32.070
Please don't do this.

20:32.540 --> 20:34.750
What are you doing? Get it over with.

20:37.960 --> 20:41.970
I'm not sure what's going on,
but we're good to free him, right?

20:42.350 --> 20:43.880
Akraptor!

20:46.990 --> 20:47.970
Gator?

20:51.510 --> 20:54.940
Shibisu, I thought you guys forfeited.

20:54.940 --> 20:56.250
I'm not sure what happened.

20:56.250 --> 21:00.060
Some kind of system error 
prevented us from forfeiting.

21:00.060 --> 21:03.930
The hosts went inside the <i>Archimedes</i>, too.

21:04.700 --> 21:05.950
What are you doing?

21:06.480 --> 21:08.950
We'll take just you if we have to.

21:09.300 --> 21:11.200
Don't move.

21:17.690 --> 21:22.110
Well, well. I wanted to avoid a fight if I could.

21:23.230 --> 21:24.590
That voice...

21:25.080 --> 21:28.670
This puts me in danger, too.

21:28.670 --> 21:31.950
Of course, I was planning to quit either way.

21:32.510 --> 21:35.220
It's good to see you again, Regulars.

21:36.730 --> 21:39.610
Something happened on the <i>Archimedes</i>, right?

21:39.610 --> 21:41.610
Viole escaped, too.

21:41.850 --> 21:46.240
Aw, darn. Maybe I should've left sooner.

21:47.450 --> 21:50.100
Reflejo, what should we—

21:50.100 --> 21:51.900
<i>Prepare for battle.</i>

21:51.900 --> 21:52.370
Huh?

21:53.640 --> 21:55.630
Preparations have been made.

21:57.810 --> 22:00.970
This will be Viole's final battle.

23:37.050 --> 23:39.180
It's good to see you again, Bam.

23:38.990 --> 23:41.250
Next Time
 The Cost of Battle

23:39.180 --> 23:40.540
Ro!
